    <h2>Steakhouse Umami on the Quick-Service Grill</h2>
  <p>While mainstream fast-food chains lean heavily on acidic pickles, yellow mustard, or sweet barbecue glazes, the Mushroom Swiss Stackburger shifts into deep, earthy comfort. Plump white button mushrooms are gently simmered until caramelized and tender, releasing rich natural glutamates. When blanketed by molten Swiss cheese—whose mild, nutty profile complements rather than masks the beef—and bound together by a smooth mushroom-herb reduction, it delivers bona fide gastropub quality. Discover our complete gourmet burger range on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

  <h2>What's on the Mushroom Swiss Stackburger</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>100% real seasoned beef patty</strong> cooked to order</li>
    <li><strong>Sautéed mushrooms:</strong> Tender, golden brown, earthy flavor</li>
    <li><strong>Swiss cheese:</strong> Mild, slightly nutty: melted on the patty</li>
    <li><strong>Creamy mushroom sauce:</strong> Brings all three mushroom elements together</li>
    <li><strong>Toasted bun:</strong> Slightly more substantial than standard buns to hold the mushrooms</li>
  </ul>

